  "releaseNotes": "IPING is a powerful IP address query tool that can help you quickly obtain detailed information such as the IP's location, application scenarios, and risk assessment. Through the agent, users can analyze the geographical location of IP addresses in real time, check whether the IP uses a proxy, assess its security risks, and support batch queries and API calls. Whether they are cybersecurity experts or developers, they can all obtain reliable IP data support through the IPING agent, enhancing work efficiency and data security.\nMain functions\nReal-time IP query: Supports the query of detailed information such as the location of IP address, operator, and ASN.\nRisk assessment: Analyze the security risk value of the IP and whether it is a proxy IP.\nBatch query support: Easily manage multiple IP addresses and quickly obtain the required data.\nAPI Integration: Convenient API interface, supporting automated query and integration.\nUse IPING to keep track of IP information at any time and enhance the level of network security protection.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Online IP address detection tool station",
